/target
.env
*.log
.claude/worktrees/

# Scratch. `docs/tmp/` is a landing strip for briefings and notes being
# worked through; nothing in it is a source of truth and nothing in it is
# reviewed.
/docs/tmp/

# Implementation plans are per-phase working documents: they argue from a
# spec in `docs/specs/`, which is the durable artefact, and they go stale
# the moment their phase merges. Kept on disk for the phase that is running,
# never committed.
/docs/plans/
